# 1) Add Bode real, Bode imag, and Bode mag modes, not only imag/phase.
# 2) Keep the plot canvas/axes from visually shrinking after selecting another plot/view.
# 3) Make Analysis Engines & Reference Comparison use browser Plot/view items as the source list, not all raw session files.
# 4) Move Analysis Engine action buttons to a visible top row instead of the lower-left area.

