# ---- FaradaIQ Studio v273 H5 browser non-shrinking plot layout fix ----
# Built from the last browser-opening stable base. v198 avoids the v197 blank-window path
# and fixes the repeated Smart Overlay shrink by never allowing colorbar/legend layout to
# steal axes width. Colorbar is inset inside the plot axes; legend is compact and inside.
# Also hides the older duplicate inline EIS-style controls outside the dedicated toolbar.
